## Control {{controlId}}: Establish and Maintain Baseline Configurations and Inventories of Organizational Systems

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization establishes and maintains baseline configurations and system inventories within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant through Microsoft Intune device configuration profiles and software inventory managed by {{variables.systemAdministrator}}.

{{#if deviceConfigurationsActive}}
**Baseline Configuration Profiles:**
{{deviceConfigurationsCount}} device configuration profiles define security baselines for managed endpoints:
{{#if configurations}}
{{#each configurations}}
- **{{displayName}}** ({{platformType}}){{#if description}} — {{description}}{{/if}} — Assigned to {{assignmentCount}} groups
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

Configuration baselines are version-controlled through Intune and updated per change management procedures. Each profile enforces security settings (firewall, antivirus, encryption, password policy) aligned with DISA STIGs and CIS benchmarks.
{{else}}
Device configuration baselines have not been established. Endpoint security configuration management is not verified.
{{/if}}

{{#if detectedAppsMonitored}}
**Software Inventory:**
{{detectedAppsCount}} applications detected across the managed device fleet:
{{#if apps}}
{{#each apps}}
- **{{displayName}}** v{{version}} — Publisher: {{publisher}} — Installed on {{deviceCount}} devices
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

Software inventory is continuously updated through Intune agent reporting, providing real-time visibility into installed applications across all managed endpoints.
{{else}}
Software inventory tracking has not been confirmed through Intune application detection.
{{/if}}

{{#if bitLockerEnforced}}
**Hardware Inventory:**
{{deviceCount}} managed devices are inventoried with hardware details (model, serial number, OS version, compliance status) tracked through Intune device management.
{{/if}}

**Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}

**Verification Method:** Examine Intune device configuration profiles, software inventory reports, hardware asset inventory, and baseline version history.

